# CC workspace meta-repo — tracks ONLY the root-level connective-tissue docs.
# Every subdirectory is its own independent {{REDACTED}}/<name> git repo and is NOT
# tracked here; this repo deliberately ignores them all to avoid nesting repos.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/VISION.md
!/CLAUDE.md
!/PRINCIPLES.md
!/PRINCIPLES-CORE.md
!/ORIGINS.md
!/audits/
# Provider-connector import shims. Python cannot import a hyphenated directory,
# and the connector pattern names the capability home `<provider>-connector/`
# (MCP.md clause 1). Each shim is a SYMLINK to that directory, so `python3 -m
# <provider>_connector` and `from <provider>_connector import dispatch` work
# from the workspace root while all the code stays in the connector's own repo.
# One tracked line per connector; no duplicated code. See _lib/CONNECTOR.md.
!/google_connector
!/proton_connector

# Root-anchored tool config (outputDir points OUTSIDE the repo — story 002).
!/playwright-mcp.config.json
